{
    "source": "flabs run 427 (nonprofit-donation-site), charlotte 0.4.0 63257c4, finished revision r6b5323a6e659fecb0a23839aa12a3c3c",
    "review": "The page is correct and accurate, with all required facts and no invented content, but it is generic and bare. It omits the supplied photo, has flat hierarchy, and shows orphaned cards at tablet width. It falls short of professional quality.}",
    "brief": {
        "summary": "Build the donation page for Riverlight, a charity that runs after-school reading\nclubs for children aged 7-11. Last year: 38 clubs, 1,140 children, 210 volunteers.\nWhat a gift does: $25 buys a book bag for one child; $60 runs a club for a week;\n$300 trains a new volunteer.\nDonate at https://give.example.org/riverlight (one-off or monthly).\nRegistered charity number 1180042. 89p of every $1 goes to the clubs.\nTone: hopeful and specific, not pitying. A photo of a reading club is at\n/images/club.jpg.",
        "facts": [
            {
